{"2550860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crow Forest: New World", "steam_appid": 2550860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550860/extras/72311415a9821da9378b6f5a1de0e11a.avif?t=1781110053\" width=780 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not fully human. Not fully infected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A failed experiment left you in between — hunted by the infected, feared by the living.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550860/extras/91ab9e77373ccc27209fe54c36fb74a2.avif?t=1781110053\" width=780 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dark, evolving forest where:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic day &amp; night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal changes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous wildlife</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable weather</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is safe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550860/extras/faaf898c788abf1fd17710beb9290a90.avif?t=1781110053\" width=780 height=80 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React to sound</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt in groups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different awareness levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They don’t just chase you.<br>They adapt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550860/extras/135644bc9aa432fd7d946cd3f110b0d4.avif?t=1781110053\" width=780 height=80 /></span></h2>